{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-1","kind":"proposition","title":"互素判定与辗转相减法","englishTitle":"Two unequal numbers being set out, and the less being continually subtracted in turn from the greater, if the number which is left never measures the one before it until an unit is left, the original numbers will be prime to one another.","book":7,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","contentId":"euclid-7-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87a7a36c0d04d89b7ec398dfcdffb5d5e24ffb796dc185ecb0c4bd31e0f922ff","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-1.statement","euclid-7-1.proof.1","euclid-7-1.proof.2","euclid-7-1.construction.1","euclid-7-1.proof.3","euclid-7-1.proof.4","euclid-7-1.proof.5","euclid-7-1.proof.6","euclid-7-1.proof.7","euclid-7-1.proof.8","euclid-7-1.conclusion","euclid-7-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c4b32bea81bf006014af920497545f9b12fc6d6beb5479a2310ad0bf6f497b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Two unequal numbers being set out, and the less being continually subtracted in turn from the greater, if the number which is left never measures the one before it until an unit is left, the original numbers will be prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个不均等的数字,如果剩下的数字从单位之前的整除数字中找不到,则原数字将是互素,则数量较少的数量会从较大数量中不断减去。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28a42ba12e981b33dab9e051bfd7a24f7252c175b569f7c72b41f94ab6f5485c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, the less of two unequal numbers AB, CD being continually subtracted from the greater, let the number which is left never measure the one before it until an unit is left; I say that AB, CD are prime to one another, that is, that an unit alone measures AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以两个不相等的AB,CD数量,从较大数量中不断减去,留有的整除数量,到单位数量离开为止,不要留下它面前的整除数量;我说,AB,CD数量是互素,也就是说,仅单位数量就整除,AB,CD数量就够了。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8059b495b053f7ceecada064b405af4c6d93ccab26027b07a2308a6682920cdc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if AB, CD are not prime to one another, some number will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AB,CD不是互素, 某些数字将达到整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25086ea51a3e6200863871765c7676af8e273127a66f2a2ecdf1310665282e8f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure them, and let it be E; let CD, measuring BF, leave FA less than itself, let AF, measuring DG, leave GC less than itself, and let GC, measuring FH, leave an unit HA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们数到整除并让它为E;CD,BF,离开的比自己少FAAF,DG,离开GC比自己少GC,FH,留下单位、HA"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a60d79b3872c8f25a3142eeb3e43efd95cca59759f156c7c9b7df436414a7675","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, E measures CD, and CD measures BF, therefore E also measures BF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此后,E 整除 CD和CD 整除 BF,因此,E也是整除 BF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f49eaeb8eddc663a107bd94d5a229dd562ef547eb691bde894809426d457ca42","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures the whole BA; therefore it will also measure the remainder AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除整个BA;因此它也将整除其余AF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5191a6d638385c0a90df707df529896e4f95c0f4dff9da1a654b880eb3c0bedb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AF measures DG; therefore E also measures DG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是AF 整除 DG,因此E 也是整除 DG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"953793bc5ef3c0d15060ce08534f6c6ab81e6dea4fd04734b398ab9133298471","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures the whole DC therefore it will also measure the remainder CG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 整个DC 因此它也将整除 其余CG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"775a040e6aef3cd19b04a5dc12cfae35d606bfe9b4d19ab820b499d55abbeb5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CG measures FH; therefore E also measures FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是CG 整除 FH,因此E 也是整除 FH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0a0278d2ebafaae6fc2ebc64760d6db70cc1120198f07c8ccf04543ed68b9e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures the whole FA; therefore it will also measure the remainder, the unit AH, though it is a number: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也包含整个FA,因此它也将包含其余的整除个,即单位 AH,尽管这是一个数字:这是不可能做到的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84015674ae793c223709d8468823c9286cf09fb9f74f88dc3809e28ec601bb73","citations":["euclid-7-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure the numbers AB, CD; therefore AB, CD are prime to one another. [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,号码为AB,CD的号码将不为整除;因此,AB,CD是互素。 [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-1.source","contentId":"euclid-7-1","revisionId":"euclid-7-1@raw-87a7a36c0d04d89b","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f0c5c85580969c4be8aaeb4789f4bbbadda1408fa3903fec91cf6a26c31af73","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-1:euclid-7-def-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-1.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 12"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-2:euclid-7-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-2.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"VII. 1"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-1:euclid-7-def-12:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-12","book":7,"number":12,"kind":"definition","title":"互素整数：公约数只有单位","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-2:euclid-7-1:explicit","id":"euclid-7-2","book":7,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"欧几里得算法：求两个整数的最大公约数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
